      "message": "Parameter value used in file name",
      "note": "HelpController#image passes params[:filename] to UserGuideLibrary.image_path, which is a WHITELIST lookup, not a filtered path build: it matches the name against the set of files that actually ship in wiki/images (built via Dir.glob, each entry realpath-checked to be inside that directory, so a symlink pointing elsewhere is excluded rather than followed). User input is only ever compared, never used to construct a path, so traversal has no spelling that works. Brakeman cannot see through the service call. Hardened in the #913/#912 follow-up branch; previously this WAS a filtered path build.",
